cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the replies dataset or the pipeline, also cite this dataset record."
title: "llm-home-bias: home-market tilt in investment advice from Chinese, American, European and Thai open-weight LLMs"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered audit of 12 open-weight language models run locally with
  Ollama on a 240-prompt factorial (investor nationality x prompt language x
  risk profile x horizon x paraphrase). Each model allocates 100% across
  eight equity markets; the panel of raw replies, parsed allocations and the
  estimation code are released. Fully reproducible from the cached replies
  with `make all`.
type: dataset
authors:
